    narr:narration """Dave Quantum’s recent communications center on a [decided infrastructure migration](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787217576351_1), specifically moving the analytics pipeline from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB. This shift is presented as a settled [strategic decision](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787217576351_3) with a concrete [Q3 2026 timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787217576351_5). The rationale for this move is framed through a lens of [performance and economic efficiency](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787217576351_2), emphasizing a projected 10x gain in query speed alongside reduced licensing costs. The discourse is consistently technical and matter-of-fact, focusing on the [quantifiable benefits](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787217576351_4) of the transition rather than the process of deliberation or potential integration risks.""" ;
